OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland road rules give
OL,4,Acampaigner hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who lost her teenage son in a
OL,7,Fcrash hopes new driving laws for newly
OL,8,Fqualified drivers in Northern Ireland
OL,9,Fwill pave the way for similar rules in
OL,10,FEngland and Wales.
OL,12,FHarvey Owen, 17, from Shrewsbury, died
OL,13,Falong with three friends when the car
OL,14,Fthey were in left a rural road near
OL,15,FGarreg, Gwynedd, in 2023, while they
OL,16,Fwere on a camping trip.
OL,18,FSince then his mother Crystal Owen has
OL,19,Fcampaigned for "graduated licences"
OL,20,Fwhich place restrictions on new drivers
OL,21,Fwith the aim of improving road safety.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
