OL,3,GNEWSANorthern Ireland road rules give
OL,4,Acampaigner hope
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland followed a number of
OL,7,Fother countries by introducing such
OL,8,Flaws on Thursday and while Owen
OL,9,Fbelieves they do not go far enough, she
OL,10,Fsaid it was a "very positive step
OL,11,Fforward".
